  "title": "Vendor Load-In Sign-In Sheet Form",
  "subtitle": "Record vendor personnel, vehicles, access devices, assigned areas, escorts, and reconciled departure from the load-in route.",
  "description": "An original day-of access register for vendor crew and vehicles. It ties each arrival to a company and load-in order, records permitted work areas, badge or key custody, escort assignment, exceptions, checkout, and missing access-device follow-up without collecting unnecessary personal details.",
  "use_case": "Use at the controlled arrival point when vendor personnel or vehicles enter for load-in, setup, service, strike, or collection. Close after departures and issued access items are reconciled or escalated.",
  "risk_tier": "A",
